  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder (0.6530 accuracy) outperform multimodal baselines. This experiment tests combining scvi_n200 RNA encoding (proven effective in single-modality) with image data via concat fusion, isolating the impact of multimodal integration. It addresses uncertainty about whether multimodal approaches can leverage strong RNA encoders to surpass single-modality performance, balancing exploration of key design choices with potential for high impact."
